        </svg></span><span>Dashboard</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/tezgrani/order-management"><span class="icon-svg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#5f5f5f">
